      "writtenOn": "2024-10-14T12:17:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Would it be simpler to check the instance name?\n\nI\u0027d also prefer to check the instance name, but it is not simpler here as that requires changing the signatures of multiple functions in the calling chain. Let me change to that version if you prefer.\n\n\u003e Or is it not guaranteed to be \"avf\"?\n\nBased on [1], the unique ID here could be used as HAL identifier. In that sense, we could use it to identify the AVF HAL.\n\n[1] https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:hardware/interfaces/security/rkp/aidl/android/hardware/security/keymint/RpcHardwareInfo.aidl;l\u003d79;drc\u003d8d046265b87f5b40c341accc72246a24d36b5e99",
      "parentUuid": "0b5d3eaf_5d4131cf",
