      "writtenOn": "2024-10-11T16:32:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we should pass a string value that describes the instance. That will be a lot more flexible, in terms of how chain policy is applied, than a boolean.\n\nI\u0027d prefer we use instance name for this string, as we will likely have some policies we want to apply for other instances in the future.",
